[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0587","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0587.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56784","title":"Linux kernel AMD Display 数组越界内存损坏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMD GPU 显示驱动（drm/amd/display）中存在数组索引越界漏洞，由于未对数组下标进行有效边界检查，攻击者可利用特制的显示操作触发越界写入，导致内存损坏。本地低权限攻击者可通过加载恶意显示配置或触发特定显示路径利用此漏洞，实现权限提升至内核态，进而完全控制系统。该漏洞影响所有使用 AMD 显卡驱动且未更新补丁的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56784"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:59Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.5 或更高版本（6.13+），对应补丁 commit 为 dff526dc3e27f5484f5ba11471b9fbbe681467f2 和 2c437d9a0b496168e1a1defd17b531f0a526dbe9。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可通过内核模块黑名单禁用 amdgpu 驱动模块（/etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-amdgpu.conf 中添加 blacklist amdgpu）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2c437d9a0b496168e1a1defd17b531f0a526dbe9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dff526dc3e27f5484f5ba11471b9fbbe681467f2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56784.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56784.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56784.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56784.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56784","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56784.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56784.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56784.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56784-drmamddisplay-adding-array-index-ch-1771408961000.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56784"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0587.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0586","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0586.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56783","title":"Linux Kernel netfilter nft_socket 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 netfilter 子系统的 nft_socket 模块中存在一处可被利用的 WARN_ON_ONCE 断言触发漏洞。由于 cgroup 最大深度默认值为 INT_MAX，且内核未对用户空间设置的 cgroup 深度进行合理限制，具有本地低权限的攻击者可通过创建深度过大的 cgroup 层级，触发 nft_socket 模块中的 WARN_ON_ONCE 宏，导致内核产生告警信息并可能引发拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响使用 netfilter nft_socket 功能的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56783"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:59Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5 或更高版本，对应补丁已合入主线及稳定分支。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 `apt update && apt upgrade` 安装 USN-7450-1 更新。Debian 用户参考 DLA-4041-1 公告更新内核。如无法立即升级，可通过内核启动参数 `cgroup_no_v1=all` 限制 cgroup 层级深度作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f9bec0a749eb646b384fde0c7b7c24687b2ffae","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7064a6daa4a700a298fe3aee11dea296bfe59fc4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b7529880cb961d515642ce63f9d7570869bbbdc3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e227c042580ab065edc610c9ddc9bea691e6fc4d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56783.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56783.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56783.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56783","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56783.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-56783.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56783.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56783-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-9vgr-6gpq-2rj5/GHSA-9vgr-6gpq-2rj5.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56783"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0586.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0585","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0585.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56782","title":"Linux Kernel ACPI 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ACPI 子系统的 x86 平台代码中存在空指针解引用漏洞，函数 `acpi_quirk_skip_serdev_enumeration()` 在调用 `acpi_dev_hid_match()` 前未对 `adev` 参数进行 NULL 检查，导致当传入的控制器父设备没有 ACPI 伴生对象时触发空指针解引用，造成内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过挂载特定设备触发该漏洞，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56782"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:58Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.5 或更高版本（6.13 及以上不受影响），或手动 cherry-pick 补丁提交 e173bce05f70 和 4a49194f587a（位于 drivers/acpi/x86/utils.c）。如无法立即升级内核，可通过内核 livepatch 机制（如 kpatch 或 KGraft）热修复 acpi_dev_hid_match() 中 adev 空指针解引用问题，或限制本地用户对 ACPI 设备枚举接口的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4a49194f587a62d972b602e3e1a2c3cfe6567966","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e173bce05f7032a8b4964cfef82a4b7668f5f3af","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56782.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56782.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56782.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56782","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-56782.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56782.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-56782-acpi-x86-add-adev-null-check-to-acp-1767883816000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-f4vg-m386-rcvq/GHSA-f4vg-m386-rcvq.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-56782","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-56782.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0585.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0584","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0584.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56781","title":"Linux Kernel PowerPC prom_init 缺少 powermac #size-cells 修复","description":"Linux kernel 的 powerpc/prom_init 中存在设备树属性缺失问题，部分 PowerMac 设备的 escc 节点缺少 #size-cells 属性，导致内核启动时触发设备树地址/大小单元解析警告（WARNING），影响系统启动流程的正常执行。该问题需要本地攻击者具有系统登录权限，通过触发内核设备树解析路径来利用。该 CVE 已被 CVE Numbering Authority 撤销，确认不属于安全漏洞范畴。Linux 主线内核已通过 prom_init 启动阶段自动补充缺失的 #size-cells 属性完成修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56781"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:19Z","updated":"2026-01-05T11:17:29Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至以下已包含补丁的版本：5.4.287、5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5 及以上。对于 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户，安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在启动参数中添加 `loglevel=3` 临时屏蔽内核 WARN 输出，但建议尽快更新内核以彻底消除该告警。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56781.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56781.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56781.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56781.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56781","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56781.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/bbefd965a9ce9fe044d0c17dd3ccf12d91932375/references/contrib1-CveServices-CVE-2024-56781-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56781.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-x99c-gp84-c52f/GHSA-x99c-gp84-c52f.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-56781"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0584.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0583","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0583.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56780","title":"Linux Kernel 配额子系统写回时工作队列刷新遗漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核配额子系统存在工作队列刷新不完整的竞态条件漏洞。在文件系统冻结过程中，`dquot_writeback_dquots()` 路径未及时刷新 `quota_release_work` 工作队列，导致冻结完成后仍有待处理的配额释放工作项。当内核随后尝试处理这些工作项时，会因文件系统已处于冻结状态而触发 `WARN_ON(sb->s_writers.frozen == SB_FREEZE_COMPLETE)` 警告，造成内核日志污染并可能引发系统不稳定。本地攻击者需具备低权限访问，通过触发文件系统冻结操作（如 `freeze_super`）与配额写回操作的特定时序即可利用此漏洞。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 ext4 等文件系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56780"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:58Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.287+、5.10.231+、5.15.174+、6.1.120+、6.6.64+、6.12.4+，或直接应用主线补丁（commit a5abba5e0e58）。Debian 11 用户请更新至 DLA-4075 对应内核版本，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 提供的 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可避免在业务高峰期执行文件系统冻结操作作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3e6ff207cd5bd924ad94cd1a7c633bcdac0ba1cb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6f3821acd7c3143145999248087de5fb4b48cf26","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8ea87e34792258825d290f4dc5216276e91cb224","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a5abba5e0e586e258ded3e798fe5f69c66fec198","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ab6cfcf8ed2c7496f55d020b65b1d8cd55d9a2cb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ac6f420291b3fee1113f21d612fa88b628afab5b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bcacb52a985f1b6d280f698a470b873dfe52728a","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56780.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56780.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56780","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56780.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-56780.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56780.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56780.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56780-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-95w3-8433-6jf6/GHSA-95w3-8433-6jf6.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56780"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0583.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0582","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0582.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56779","title":"Linux Kernel nfsd 并发打开操作导致内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 NFS 服务器（NFSD）在处理并发 nfsd4_open 请求时存在 nfs4_openowner 内存泄漏漏洞。当客户端执行强制卸载（umount -f）操作时，会终止所有正在进行的 RPC 任务，导致客户端可能同时发送两个 RPC 任务到 NFS 服务器处理同一文件的打开请求。由于 NFSD 可并发运行多个实例，两个 nfsd 线程同时处理同一文件的打开操作时会触发竞态条件：一个线程分配或查找 nfs4_openowner 后，另一个线程发现该 owner 未标记为 NFS4_OO_CONFIRMED 而将其释放并从客户端链表中删除，但第一个线程继续使用已释放的 owner 关联 stateid 和 nfsd_file，导致 nfs4_openowner、stateid、nfsd_file 及 nfsd_file_mark 等多重对象泄漏。大量内存泄漏最终在关闭 NFSD 线程时触发内核 slab 内存池警告，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞需本地低权限用户触发，CVSS 评分 5.5。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56779"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：5.4.287、5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.64 或 6.12.4 及以上。对于无法立即升级的系统，可限制本地用户执行强制卸载（umount -f）操作，并避免在 NFS 服务端并发处理大量打开请求，以降低内存泄漏风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0ab0a3ad24e970e894abcac58f85c332d1726749","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d505a801e57428057563762f67a5a62009b2600","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/37dfc81266d3a32294524bfadd3396614f8633ee","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/45abb68c941ebc9a35c6d3a7b08196712093c636","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6f73f920b7ad0084373e46121d7ac34117aed652","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/98100e88dd8865999dc6379a3356cd799795fe7b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a85364f0d30dee01c5d5b4afa55a9629a8f36d8e","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56779.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56779.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56779","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56779.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56779.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-56779.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56779.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56779-2025-11-03-1451","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-v6jm-7r7p-9979/GHSA-v6jm-7r7p-9979.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56779"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0582.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0581","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0581.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56778","title":"Linux kernel drm/sti 错误指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM/STI 显示驱动中的 sti_hqvdp_atomic_check 函数在调用 drm_atomic_get_crtc_state() 时未对返回值进行有效性检查，当该函数返回错误指针时直接解引用将导致空指针访问或内存损坏。本地低权限攻击者可通过提交特制的原子模式设置请求触发此漏洞，造成系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。厂商已在内核主线提交修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56778"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:58Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.64、6.12.4 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应修复提交为 c1ab40a1fdfe（主线）及各稳定分支的向后移植提交。对于 Ubuntu 系统，安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 安全更新；Debian 系统参考 DLA-4075-1 公告。如无法立即升级，可通过内核模块黑名单禁用 sti 驱动（modprobe.blacklist=sti）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/31c857e7496d34e5a32a6f75bc024d0b06fd646a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6b0d0d6e9d3c26697230bf7dc9e6b52bdb24086f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/82a5312f874fb18f045d9658e9bd290e3b0621c0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/837eb99ad3340c7a9febf454f41c8e3edb68ac1e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c1ab40a1fdfee732c7e6ff2fb8253760293e47e8","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56778.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56778.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56778.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56778","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56778.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56778.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56778-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56778.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-x9pj-5qm2-7p6v/GHSA-x9pj-5qm2-7p6v.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56778"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0581.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0580","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0580.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56777","title":"Linux kernel drm/sti 错误指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM/STI 显示子系统的 sti_gdp_atomic_check 函数中存在错误指针解引用漏洞。drm_atomic_get_crtc_state() 函数在特定失败情况下会返回错误指针，而 sti_gdp_atomic_check 未对返回值进行有效性检查，直接使用该指针进行操作，导致内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过加载特制的显示状态触发该错误路径，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。需更新至包含修复补丁的内核版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56777"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:58Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.64 或 6.12.4 及以上（对应修复 commit: 3cf2e7c44、997b64c3f、b79612ed6、e965e771b、f5804567c）。使用 apt/yum 等包管理器更新内核包后重启系统即可生效。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 STI 显示驱动模块（modprobe -r sti）作为临时缓解措施，但会导致 STI 图形输出不可用。","