id":"AVE-2024-0579","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0579.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56776","title":"Linux kernel DRM/STI 错误指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM 子系统中 STI 显示驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞，drm_atomic_get_crtc_state() 函数在内存分配失败或参数异常时可能返回错误指针（ERR_PTR），但驱动未对返回值进行有效性检查便直接解引用，导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过触发特定的 DRM 原子操作来利用此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56776"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:57Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.64、6.12.4 或 6.13 及以上。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新，例如 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 或执行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-*`；Debian 用户参考 DLA-4045-1 公告更新内核包。更新后需重启系统生效。如无法立即更新，可卸载或禁用 sti 内核模块（`modprobe -r sti`）作为临时缓解措施，但可能影响显示输出功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/40725c5fabee804fecce41d4d5c5bae80c45e1c4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/831214f77037de02afc287eae93ce97f218d8c04","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8ab73ac97c0fa528f66eeccd9bb53eb6eb7d20dc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e98ff67f5a68114804607de549c2350d27628fc7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f67786293193cf01ebcc6fdbcbd1587b24f52679","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56776.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56776.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56776.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56776","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56776.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56776.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56776-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56776.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-93c4-8fxm-4wq3/GHSA-93c4-8fxm-4wq3.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56776"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0579.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0578","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0578.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56775","title":"Linux kernel AMD Display 驱动平面引用计数内存管理漏洞","description":"Linux kernel 的 AMD 显示驱动（drm/amd/display）中存在平面（plane）引用计数处理缺陷。备份和恢复平面状态时未正确维护引用计数，若在备份与恢复操作之间引用计数发生变化，可能导致内存泄漏（引用计数本应减少时）或双重释放/非法内存访问（引用计数本应增加时）。本地攻击者需具备低权限，通过触发特定显示状态切换操作即可利用该漏洞，造成系统崩溃或权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56775"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:57Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.4 或更高版本（包含补丁 commit 8cb2f6793845f 和 27227a234c14）。各发行版用户：Ubuntu 安装 USN-7381-1/USN-7450-1 安全更新，RHEL/CentOS 使用 `yum update kernel`，Debian 使用 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image`，更新后重启系统。如无法立即升级，可通过内核模块黑名单临时禁用 amdgpu 驱动：`echo \"blacklist amdgpu\" >> /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-amdgpu.conf && update-initramfs -u`，但此措施将禁用 AMD 图形加速功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/27227a234c1487cb7a684615f0749c455218833a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8cb2f6793845f135b28361ba8e96901cae3e5790","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56775.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56775.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56775.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56775.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56775","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56775.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56775.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-56775-drmamddisplay-fix-handling-of-plane-1767883807000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-pm49-6j2c-6857/GHSA-pm49-6j2c-6857.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56775"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0578.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0577","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0577.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56774","title":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux kernel 的 btrfs 文件系统在 btrfs_search_slot() 函数中缺少对 btrfs root 的空指针检查。当系统使用 rescue=ibadroots 挂载参数且 extent tree root 损坏时，extent tree 为 NULL，此时 scrub 操作尝试搜索 extent tree 获取 extent 信息时，btrfs_search_slot() 未校验目标 root 是否为空，导致空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃。该漏洞需要本地低权限用户触发特定条件利用，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。Linux 内核主线已通过添加健全性检查修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56774"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.64、6.12.4 或 6.13 及以上版本。各发行版用户可通过包管理器更新内核（如 Ubuntu 运行 apt upgrade linux-image-generic，Debian 运行 apt upgrade linux-image）。如无法立即升级，避免使用 rescue=ibadroots 挂载选项挂载损坏的 btrfs 文件系统，并在生产环境中禁用 scrub 操作对不可信文件系统的扫描。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ed51857a50f530ac7a1482e069dfbd1298558d4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/757171d1369b3b47f36932d40a05a0715496dcab","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/93992c3d9629b02dccf6849238559d5c24f2dece","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c71d114ef68c95da5a82ec85a721ab31f5bd905b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/db66fb87c21e8ae724886e6a464dcbac562a64c6","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56774.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56774.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56774.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56774","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56774.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56774.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56774-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56774.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-phf7-cpqm-749x/GHSA-phf7-cpqm-749x.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56774"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0577.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0576","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0576.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56770","title":"Linux kernel netem 网络调度器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核网络调度器 netem 的 qlen 计数器存在计数不一致漏洞。netem 作为根 qdisc 使用时，其 qlen 仅统计内部 tfifo 队列中的报文数，未正确计入子 qdisc（如 tbf）中排队的报文。当子 qdisc 通过 qdisc_tree_reduce_backlog 通知 netem 创建或丢弃 SKB 时，netem 的 qlen 被错误更新，导致 qlen 与 tfifo 实际队列深度不一致。攻击者可在本地通过构造特定流量（如启用 GSO 并配置 netem+tbf 组合），使 netem 的 qlen 达到配置的 limit 上限，即使 tfifo 实际为空也无法接收新报文，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 netem 与子 qdisc 组合的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56770"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T17:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级到以下已修复版本：5.4.288、5.10.232、5.15.175、6.1.121、6.6.67、6.12.6 或更高版本。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新（如 Debian 11/12 请参考 DLA-4075-1 公告，Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7506-1 更新）。如无法立即升级，临时缓解措施为避免将 netem 与 tbf 等子 qdisc 配合使用，或禁用 GSO（ethtool -K <接口> gso off）以防止子 qdisc 分段触发 qlen 计数异常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/10df49cfca73dfbbdb6c4150d859f7e8926ae427","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/216509dda290f6db92c816dd54b83c1df9da9e76","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/356078a5c55ec8d2061fcc009fb8599f5b0527f9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3824c5fad18eeb7abe0c4fc966f29959552dca3e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/83c6ab12f08dcc09d4c5ac86fdb89736b28f1d31","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c2047b0e216c8edce227d7c42f99ac2877dad0e4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f8d4bc455047cf3903cd6f85f49978987dbb3027","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56770.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56770.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/SEC-bench/SEC-bench-Pro/blob/798fe5865a23d1d1dd1aaee2729abd2faf4899d1/projects/linux/CVE-2024-56770/VERIFIED.txt","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56770","https://github.com/peass-ng/PEASS-ng/blob/1cabd84639d48c21ba088e07e52661c30c906aef/linPEAS/builder/linpeas_parts/variables/kernel_cve_registry_data.sh","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56770.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-56770.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56770.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56770-2025-11-03-1451"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0576.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0559","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55459","title":"Keras 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Keras 3.7.0 的 get_file 函数存在任意文件写入漏洞（CWE-494）。攻击者可构造包含符号链接或路径遍历载荷的恶意 tar 压缩包，通过诱导用户调用 get_file 函数下载并解压该文件，利用解压过程中未对文件路径进行充分校验的缺陷，将恶意文件写入用户系统的任意目录。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要用户交互，对系统完整性造成高影响，可能导致代码执行或敏感文件覆盖。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55459"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T17:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:08Z","remediation":"立即将 Keras 升级至 3.12.3 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade keras>=3.12.3`），该版本已对 `get_file` 函数中的 tar 文件提取进行多项安全加固，包括拒绝硬链接逃逸、阻止符号链接目录遍历、拒绝解压炸弹攻击、使用 `filter=\"data\"` 安全提取模式。如无法立即升级，应避免使用 `get_file` 从不可信来源下载并解压 tar 文件，或在使用前手动校验 tar 文件内容是否包含路径穿越符号链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/keras-team/keras","https://keras.io","https://river-bicycle-f1e.notion.site/Arbitrary-File-Write-Vulnerability-in-get_file-function-11888e31952580179224e50892976d32","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-55459.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55459.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-55459.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/keras/CVE-2024-55459.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-55459","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55459.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-55459.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/cba1106e73e57152f6afbb7764cd551d404f7b74/vulns/keras/PYSEC-2025-121.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/github-reviewed/2025/01/GHSA-cjgq-5qmw-rcj6/GHSA-cjgq-5qmw-rcj6.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-55459"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0559.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0558","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55414","title":"Motorola SM56 Modem WDM Driver 权限提升漏洞","description":"Motorola SM56 Modem WDM 驱动程序 SmSerl64.sys 存在权限提升漏洞，低权限用户可通过向驱动发送特制的 IOCTL 请求映射物理内存，从而获取系统最高权限执行任意代码并泄露敏感信息。该驱动因持有有效数字签名，可绕过微软驱动签名策略被用于加载恶意代码。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。受影响的驱动版本为 v6.12.23.0，建议立即禁用或替换该驱动。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55414"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-07T18:15:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:06Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Motorola SM56 Modem WDM Driver v6.12.23.0，在设备管理器中找到该调制解调器驱动并选择\"卸载设备\"；使用 Microsoft Defender for Identity 或 Windows Defender Application Control (WDAC) 将 SmSerl64.sys 加入阻止列表；在企业环境中通过组策略禁止非授权驱动加载，并启用 HVCI（Hypervisor-protected Code Integrity）阻止已知有问题的内核驱动运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/heyheysky/vulnerable-driver/blob/master/CVE-2024-55414/CVE-2024-55414_SmSerl64.sys_README.md","https://us.motorola.com/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55414.json","https://github.com/splintersfury/KernelSight/blob/c4101ef9174b083b99cf79d99e0c61308bb26f06/docs/case-studies/CVE-2024-55414.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55414.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-55414","https://github.com/magicsword-io/LOLDrivers/blob/35d5ade5c33246ab6cc9565bded5fd7aff0e689e/loldrivers.io/content/drivers/09c46890-5aa1-4122-962e-7ed94754e710.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-55414.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7c78b01f402841eaeb570a26d276cd67a60a9531/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-6prq-q63r-xqhp/GHSA-6prq-q63r-xqhp.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2024-55414","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-55414.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-55414.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0561","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55553","title":"FRRouting FRR 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FRRouting（FRR）在处理 RTR（RPKI-to-Router）协议更新时存在资源管理不当漏洞（CWE-404）。当单次 RTR 更新数据总量超过操作系统默认套接字缓冲区大小（通常为 4KB）时，FRR 会触发对所有路由的重新验证。攻击者可通过在更新间隔内（通常为 30 分钟）发送超过该阈值的 ROA 更新，迫使目标 FRR 路由器持续重新解析 RIB（路由信息库），导致路由处理性能严重下降。对于维护大型全量路由表的路由器，单次重新验证可能超过 30 分钟，攻击者可利用持续签发/撤销大量 ROA 的方式影响全球所有使用 RPKI 的 FRR 实例的路由处理能力，同时导致 BMP（BGP 监控协议）流量激增。该漏洞影响 FRR 6.0 至 10.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。修复版本为 10.0.3、10.1.2、10.2.1 及 10.3 以上。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55553"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T23:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:13Z","remediation":"升级 FRRouting 至 10.0.3、10.1.2、10.2.1 或 10.3 及以上版本。补丁提交见 https://github.com/FRRouting/frr/pull/17586。如无法立即升级，可通过 `sysctl -w net.core.rmem_default=65536` 临时增大 RTR 套接字接收缓冲区大小（默认 4KB），降低因缓冲区满触发全量路由重校验的频率，但此缓解措施不能完全消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://frrouting.org/security/cve-2024-55553/","https://github.com/FRRouting/frr/pull/17586/commits/b0800bfdf04b4fcf48504737ebfe4ba7f05268d3","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00023.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55553.json","https://github.com/FRRouting/frr-www/blob/597982afc99050d3f7f2de614e1e88370e98fa67/content/security/CVE-2024-55553.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-55553.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-55553","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55553.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2024-55553-2025-01-23-1705","https://github.com/FRRouting/frr/blob/e6d5610e2022680f9555641241419a58625d2dc4/redhat/frr.spec.in","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-networking/recipes-protocols/frr/frr/CVE-2024-55553.patch","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-55553-in-frrouting-frr-all-routes-are-re--1771406778000.md","https://github.com/opensourcerouting/frr-cves/blob/4b374c7d216bff70f86a0158215cf264f05eed32/CVE-2024-55553/_index.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0561.toml"}]